        },
        {
          "text": " kikunyakis kesi neejai Serubabel, ka ikapolok luka ikekia luka lukapapakee, kobalas ebe, “Mere kadukoto nepepe kayes: naarai kimoot isio Ekusideke, kwape kayesi; kiinakini isio ŋes asuban ageun kapaarasia nuka Esar-kadon ekabaka loka Asuria lokitodokuni sio nee.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
