        },
        {
          "text": " Konye Serubabel, ka Yesua ka ice kere luka ikapolok luka ikekia luka lukapapa luka Isirael, kotemasi kes atiar, “Mam kipuda yes aimorikikin kasio kotoma aiduk etogo loka Ekosideke; konye sic kiduki bonik etogo loka EJAKAIT, Edeke loka Isirael, kwape abu Kuro ekabaka loko Perusia kicorakinia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
